# A project saved by X0X 1.3, before PC IN CH and the PC MAP (tests/fixtures/v13_store.bin, made in 1.3's
# simulator: the 909's kick on the quarters in P1 and on step 1 in P2, 120 BPM, the song P1 P2, MIX MIDI
# CH 5) loads as it was, with PC IN CH OFF and an empty map, and saves again in today's format.
wait 100
storeload tests/fixtures/v13_store.bin
reboot
wait 300
expect pattern 1
expect hit0.0.0 1
expect hit0.0.4 1
expect tempo 120
expect songlen 2
expect songbar2.0 2
expect mixchset 5
expect pcch 0
expect pcmapped 0
midi C9 70 00
wait 100
expect pattern 1
# saved in today's format (the stream with the map), it loads the same
tap SAVE
wait 1500
reboot
wait 300
expect pattern 1
expect hit0.0.4 1
expect songlen 2
expect mixchset 5
expect pcch 0
expect pcmapped 0
